Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.63,0:01:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you a promise that\Nin five turns I would
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.05,0:01:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,teach you a lesson that\Nyou would never forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and I intend to make good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have four turns left, Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.53,0:01:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Four more turns before I\Ndrag you from your shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and show you up for the\Nbully that you truly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten whom you face here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Panic, the Obliminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to scare me,\Nor are you running scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki's playing with fire, I sure\Nhope he knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.37,0:02:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this panic nut job\Nis playing for keeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic enjoys breaking people down,\Nmaking them sweat, watching them squirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.23,0:02:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,For him, dueling is just an\Nexcuse to practice his cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.75,0:02:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stall forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you'll\Nhave to make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This beast will win the\Nentire match for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Yamimakai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Powered up with the field power bonus\Nthat all my monsters get from the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.93,0:02:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,my King of Yamimakai is far more\Npowerful than your pitiful creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.83,0:02:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Yamimakai, destroy\Nhis curse of dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my king of Yamimakai,\NElectroshock Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.85,0:03:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's veering away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of destroying Yugi's curse of\Ndragon, it's attacking my Reaper of the Gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, your reaper of\Nthe cards is vanquished!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic messed up! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you and your spell-finding circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Its light drew in my energy blast\Nand destroyed my precious monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.15,0:03:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't do well when they\Ndare step out of the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's bring all your\Nmonsters into the light! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.43,0:04:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I dispel all your darkness with\Nthe Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monsters are revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.93,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one keeps Yugi in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Panic's cards are revealed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No more hiding, Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your darkness will shield you no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three turns left and then you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.09,0:04:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't use the swords just\Nto illuminate your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It also causes all your monsters on\Nthe field to be frozen for three turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,starting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you can't make any attack\Nwhile I implement my strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this upstart think he can panic me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be planning an\Nattack on his next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but the only monster he has on\Nthe field is Curse of Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,while I still have three\Nmighty monsters of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrox, Dark Chimera,\Nand King of Yami Makai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite Yu-Gi's swords\Nare revealing light,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,my monsters still get a\Npower bonus from the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And after three turns,\Nthey'll be free once more,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yugi will beg me to end this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stalling, Panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Afraid to draw your next card?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.73,0:05:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He continues to goad me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually my opponents are\Nsobbing and broken by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.83,0:05:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But she is not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I will relish crushing his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.49,0:05:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is the card to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you can forget your foolish delusion\Nof defeating me in just three turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've drawn a Chaos Shield card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,oh no that affects all the monsters on\Nthe field it puts them all in defense mode
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.11,0:05:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and raises their defense points you're\Nthinking too small you fool or don't you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,realize that I can combine my chaos shield\Nwith my castle of dark illusions this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,is bad with this combination I can project\Na defensive shield over my entire area
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yugi can't get\Nanywhere near his monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic's untouchable while\NYu-Gi's a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the Chaos Shield is in\Nplace, your monsters can't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still think you can\Ndefeat me in three turns,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You impudent shrimp, admit\Ndefeat now. You can see
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,how the shield raises\Nthe defense points of my
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters he's right that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,shield protects against
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,any possible attacks even\Nfrom my strongest monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,i hate to say it but yugi really\Ndoesn't stand a chance breaking duelists
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what panic does for a living. Panic\Nis brutal, ruthless, everything the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,ultimate duelist needs to be my you've\Nbecome so cynical about duel monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and you don't understand yuki at all\Nreally there's much more to him than
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,meets the eye joey yuki can win this\Nright man i wish i could tell you but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,after the way panic beat my i got no\Nidea what yuki's chances are give up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,admit defeat i'm going to crack you like\Nan egg you'd like me to crack wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you panic because it's worked for you\Nbefore winning through intimidation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,not through skill you mock my skill\Nmy skill is what's defeating you don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,be so sure what do you mean by that you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,think you're winning that your tactics
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,are taking me by surprise but i saw\Nyour strategy the minute i saw what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of man you are you're talking\Nnonsense i knew you would use chaos shield
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,cowardly bullies like you always try\Nto hide behind something shut up i'm in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,no way a coward and i never try to hide\Nbehind anything your whole strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,is nothing but hiding and cowering
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you dare to call me a coward you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,insignificant little worm nobody talks
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to me that way i am panic the eliminator
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you going to\Ncontinue to hide behind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,your bluster and battlements\Nlike a big coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth hurts, doesn't it, Panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing up to your true self is usually\Nmore than bullies like you can bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so you hide in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You will taunt me no longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! He's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've just got to stop stirring him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's just using Panic's\Nown tactics against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's psych-out warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I will burn you to a cinder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That would prove you're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not afraid, then you should\Nstop hiding and play this game with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I will rip your pathetic,\Nfearsome facade away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You bluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one way you'll know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Play out this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In two turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you last?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just two turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have the courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have the courage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic fears no duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I will crush your spirit and\Nwipe out your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, Yuki really shook Panic up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Psychology is half the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And my card is Gaia, the Fierce Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.31,0:10:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a\Nmonster with attack power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that weak can break\Nthrough my Chaos Shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe not by himself, but\NI also have a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Free it and weep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A polymerization card!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And with this card...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I combined them to create\NGaia, the Dragon Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my combo creature's attack\Npower is raised to 2,600!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn's over, but\Nyou're finished as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows that even with\Nan attack power of 2,600,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,the Dragon Champion's still not strong\Nenough to break through the Chaos Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be more to his plan than\Nthat, otherwise he wouldn't be so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't risk attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I just wait one more turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the paralyzing effects of Yugi's Swords\Nof Revealing Light will wear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll deactivate\Nmy Chaos Shield and my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters will be free to\Nattack him all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Metal Guardian in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He will further shield my creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and the field power bonus raises\Nhis defense power to 27.95!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,With him on guard, any attack against\Nmy monsters is totally impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, it figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cowering again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolent dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your strategy is nothing but putting up\Ndefenses. You're showing how weak you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In the next turn, the Swords\Nof Light will be extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.87,0:11:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll hit you with everything at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already led you deep into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The stronger you make your defenses,\Nthe more you lock yourself into defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.05,0:12:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for talk is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your last turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Catapult Turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow and Steady wins the duel, Panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for I can use the Turtle's\NCatapult to launch
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia the Dragon Champion\Nand shatter your defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Catapult Launch raises Gaia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Champion's attack\Npower all the way up to 3200!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't expecting that, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's defense power is\Nstill much too strong for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Protected as they are by the Chaos\NShield, you still can't touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only watch helplessly as they\Nprepare to assault you next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said anything about\Nattacking your monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm attacking is the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My castle is still unassailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Its walls are still invincible\Nto any of your attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So I won't take any damage at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtle, catapult launch\Nmy dragon champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Yugi flushed a lot of\Npoints with that maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he sacrificed his dragon champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an awfully big loss, both\Nin monsters and life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.09,0:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And if this attack doesn't bring\Ndown that castle, then next turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:14:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic will wipe out the\Nrest of Yugi's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.01,0:14:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's still floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool, for all your threats,\Nmy castle is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your worthless attack simply\Nknocked its flotation ring off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.89,0:14:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that your attack has failed,\NI'll eliminate you once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.97,0:14:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been five turns, and\NI'm still standing, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My monsters are still contained and\Nprotected within the Chaos Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When this turn is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the paralyzing effects of your Swords\Nof Revealing Light will vanish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then on my turn, I'll attack you with all\Nof my monsters and wipe you out forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no next turn for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has already ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it seem strange to\Nyou that a castle that's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,lost its flotation ring\Nis somehow still floating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.51,0:15:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the Swords of Revealing Light had\Nlocked in place not only your monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but your castle as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what would happen next?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be. It can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the only thing holding up your\Ncastle are the Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.13,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And when this turn ends, each\Nand every sword will vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean? It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now your world's about\Nto come tumbling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No one defeats Panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn is over
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Run monsters, get out of the\Nway. No good, the chaos shield is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping them from running anywhere\Nyou've trapped them all inside
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And Panic's not taking it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic's having a panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody beats Panic. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him, that smug little worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, he mocks me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not have defeated you, Yugi,\Nbut I can still eliminate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trapped by the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And he can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.67,0:16:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who's the coward now! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's going to be fried to a crisp! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You survived. How can this be? It's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.23,0:17:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,impossible my millennium puzzle protects
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,me from your cowardly assault but\Nnothing will protect you from oblivion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you were incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Millennium Puzzle has\Nmore power than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.89,0:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did it protect Yugi, but it also\Nsaved all of us from the flames, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,These star chips are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They're yours. Take them. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I fight my own battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, Yugi battled for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He risked his life in this duel for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She's way too thick-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But if she'd rather be booted\Noff the island, I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You think me losing all my star\Nchips is funny, Joey Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.95,0:18:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you didn't want him, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, really, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you learn anything from this duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't always keep your defenses up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they'll just\Nget between you and the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,other people who are\Ntrying to be your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So can't you let your shield down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:18:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.11,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.02,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a sensitive guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, when you're not being a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is most of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.47,0:19:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my adoring fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll repay you for what you did today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who won these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.37,0:19:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So far as I'm concerned, I still owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,More than I've ever owed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we finally do face each other\Nin a duel, it'll be an honorable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.99,0:19:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, an honorable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a duel I'd look forward to, my.
